<title>USA: Walter Industries repurchases 1.4 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Walter Industries repurchases 1.4 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walter Industries Inc said Wednesday that it repurchased 1,387,092 shares of its outstanding common stock in a private transaction executed after the close of trading on June 24.</p>
<p>As a result the company said it now has 53,676,320 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
